      "position": { "x": 750, "y": 0 },
      "type": "conversation",
      "settings": {
        "on_enter_text": "Okay, thank you. What is the reason for your visit? For example, a routine cleaning, a check-up, or are you experiencing any pain? Based on that, I can find available times.",
